{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18260490","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260490","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1826046001:":{"text":"No... no!","source_cn":"不……不……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8750FF1FDED97D91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1826046002:":{"text":"Shh, stay still.","source_cn":"嘘，别动","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA96B3344D424759","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1826046003:":{"text":"Or I might hit somewhere that hurts even more.","source_cn":"否则打偏了，可不能怪我","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DB5B9B05E901120","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1826046004:":{"text":"Please... Have mercy on me!","source_cn":"饶了我……求您饶了我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAB6A9560D4AC6EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826047001:1":{"text":"I hadn't expected you to buckle so quickly... You really are spineless.","source_cn":"没想到你竟然这么快就求饶了，真是……没有骨气啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x017FECA5B1DFC9EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826047002:1":{"text":"Now, shall we play a little game?","source_cn":"不如这样，我们来做一个游戏如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D6E9143AB901C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826047003:1":{"text":"Answer my questions correctly, and you'll be rewarded. If you get them wrong... you'll suffer.","source_cn":"如果你能答对，我就给你奖励。但要是你答错了……我也只能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3534EBCB96E690E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826047004:1":{"text":"I-I don't want anything! Please... just let me go!","source_cn":"我……我不要奖励！只求求……求求您放过我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB852060346B5624B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826047005:1":{"text":"That's not for you to decide.","source_cn":"那可不是你说了算的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76D6538A44128D8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826047006:1":{"text":"Tell me... How long has it been since Lady Tephesia, that insufferable little vampire, last showed her face?","source_cn":"我问你，你们的领主……那个恶劣的小吸血鬼，有多久没出现了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCB201093439D11C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826047007:0":{"text":"I-I may hold a noble title, but I've never had the privilege of meeting Her Lady—","source_cn":"我……我只是个小贵族，根本接触不到领主阁——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x710FD38FA734DC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826047008:1":{"text":"<shk>Ow!!!</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>——啊！！！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x319478B3A62DF551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826047009:0":{"text":"My, what a piercing scream. Look around you. So many of your friends are waiting their turn. Think carefully, and don't waste my time with useless answers.","source_cn":"虽然我很享受你的尖叫，但看看周围——还有这么多人在等待...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29F71A7A2F95624F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826047010:0":{"text":"F-Fine! I-I'll talk!","source_cn":"我、我说……我说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC03A0CEEEC014ECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826047011:1":{"text":"I think... Her Ladyship's never been seen since the lockdown began and the theater suspended its shows!","source_cn":"是从……从戒严以后，海歌剧院演出暂停……领主阁下就再也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90FE351E0EF0D109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826047012:1":{"text":"B-But when the explosion happened on Crescent Street, someone claimed to have seen her there... gravely injured...","source_cn":"不、不过，月弯街发生爆炸的时候……有人说在街上看到了她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DCE03962005AA3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826047013:1":{"text":"I-I'm not sure if it's true! I didn't see her with my own eyes...","source_cn":"但是……但是我不知道那是不是真的，我没有亲眼见到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCC8C5D48BE743A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826047014:1":{"text":"That's... a fine answer!","source_cn":"嗯……这个问题你答得不错，我很满意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D59295D6BDA4E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826047015:1":{"text":"Hmm... How should I reward your effort...","source_cn":"让我想想，该奖励你什么才好呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x398AD5D23E37D5EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1826047016:1":{"text":"Please... I want to go home!","source_cn":"求您……求您饶了我吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x338AC6A1B0E8FE9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1826047017:1":{"text":"Go home? Oh, where's the fun in that?","source_cn":"饶了你？多么无趣的提议啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290028C1E3AA222A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1826047018:1":{"text":"Ah, here's an idea. I'll give you... the chance to answer one more question!","source_cn":"啊，我想到了。你的奖励是……再回答我一个问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB710351A680A8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1826047019:1":{"text":"Baba Muriel, the physician from the Repair House... Where is she now?","source_cn":"修缮屋的医师——那个穆婆婆，她去哪了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7418284EC148C2CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1826047020:1":{"text":"I-I haven't the faintest idea! She's vanished!","source_cn":"我、我不知道！她失踪了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFED6F2978B8CBCD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1826047021:1":{"text":"All I know is that Bantus is after her for sabotaging a military base, and her wanted posters are plastered all over Novaris... The army even imposed a lockdown to catch her. We're too scared to leave our homes...","source_cn":"班题斯说她破坏了军事基地，城里到处都是通缉令……军队为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75AA43A6B011349A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1826047022:1":{"text":"M-Maybe... the Bantus army has already captured her! Y-Yes, that could explain why she's been missing for so long!","source_cn":"说不定……说不定她已经被军队抓走了！对，对……她消失了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B174E38FBC9DEB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1826047023:1":{"text":"Captured by the Bantus army? Heh heh...","source_cn":"被班题斯军队抓走了？呵呵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37904B4EA6F296DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1826047024:1":{"text":"Since you're so certain, stop struggling and take your punishment!","source_cn":"既然你这么信誓旦旦，那就别再挣扎了。乖乖受罚吧——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A8CCC04332B9E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1826047025:1":{"text":"<shk>Please... don't!!! Agh...</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>不……不要！！啊——！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9404357E9DB22D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1826048001:":{"text":"Agh!","source_cn":"啊——！<key:dialog88>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4DACE20C3159782","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1826048002:":{"text":"You asked for this!","source_cn":"这不正是你所期待的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x717B76BBF6619D80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1826048003:":{"text":"I've got something...","source_cn":"有结果了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36BF2FC529405E16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:33:1826048004:":{"text":"Tsk, you've spoiled my fun.","source_cn":"真扫兴","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B4B7137A950A1AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1826049001:0":{"text":"Vulture, didn't your liege teach you not to interrupt a man at his pleasures?","source_cn":"秃鹫，你的主君难道没有告诉过你，不要打搅他人的享乐时间吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x080E4AB08F434F45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1826049002:1":{"text":"I found... the mage.","source_cn":"魔法师，下落……找到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7B3539049B02699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1826049003:1":{"text":"Oh? Are you sure it's the one who destroyed the Refinery?","source_cn":"哦？你确定你的目标就是破坏炼化间的那个魔法师？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10E6D7AED4EE2958","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1826049004:1":{"text":"Positive. He's a Lightbearer.","source_cn":"<male>他</male><female>她</fe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD785E7AC23E0294D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Positive. He's a Lightbearer.","female":"Positive. She's a Lightbearer.","variant_male_record_index":"251306","variant_female_record_index":"251307","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1826049005:1":{"text":"Where's he now?","source_cn":"<male>他</male><female>她</fe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x35A08770C19FF781","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Where's he now?","female":"Where's she now?","variant_male_record_index":"251308","variant_female_record_index":"251309","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1826049006:1":{"text":"Castle... Where the vampire lives.","source_cn":"城堡……吸血鬼的，城堡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D1511826123E8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1826049007:1":{"text":"On my mission... I didn't see him. But he... reached the castle before you.","source_cn":"执行任务时，没见过<male>他</male><fem...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE8A5187C53E9115B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"On my mission... I didn't see him. But he... reached the castle before you.","female":"On my mission... I didn't see her. But she... reached the castle before you.","variant_male_record_index":"251311","variant_female_record_index":"251312","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1826049008:1":{"text":"And then... that mage never came out.","source_cn":"然后……没出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EBF7840B3AD7E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1826049009:1":{"text":"Are you saying he was hiding somewhere in the castle while I was speaking with Tephesia?","source_cn":"这么说来，我拜访苔佩希的时候，<male>他</mal...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB5462389448A5723","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"Are you saying he was hiding somewhere in the castle while I was speaking with Tephesia?","female":"Are you saying she was hiding somewhere in the castle while I was speaking with Tephesia?","variant_male_record_index":"251314","variant_female_record_index":"251315","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1826049010:1":{"text":"Yes.","source_cn":"对。<key:dialog88>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD538E2D3636C18DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1826049011:1":{"text":"Now that is interesting...","source_cn":"那就有意思了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01858864416CCC9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1826049012:1":{"text":"Are you sure you left that vampire half-dead?","source_cn":"你确定你的刺杀没有失手，那只吸血鬼百分之百重伤垂危吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA533475E24A3215C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1826049013:1":{"text":"She's... in bad shape. I... poisoned her to keep her bleeding.","source_cn":"她……状态很差。我……用毒，让她一直流血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC104A55BF4565D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1826049014:1":{"text":"My lady said... vampires can't lose too much blood.","source_cn":"主君说……吸血鬼害怕，失去太多血液。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73ED804D3BE54DA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1826049015:1":{"text":"Good.\nYou do make quite a useful pet for your lady.","source_cn":"很好。\\n看来你这宠物还算有用，你的主君没有白养你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB642867E294BE4E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1826049016:1":{"text":"... Pet? I don't understand.","source_cn":"宠物……？不明白。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30E9E25A1499361A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1826049017:1":{"text":"You don't need to. Just know that Novaris is about to change hands, and I shall be its new ruler.","source_cn":"你不需要明白，只需要知道：诺珐斯即将易主。而我，会是新...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E83F3EBBE4D0182","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1826049018:1":{"text":"You may go now. I'll call upon you when I need you again.","source_cn":"退下吧，等待我的下一条命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF890A0AB74C20CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1826049019:1":{"text":"Go? No... I only take orders from my lady.","source_cn":"退下？不行……这不是，主君的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB40E5B69AFE4585A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1826049020:1":{"text":"Besides... <style=\"highlight\">Karma is outside the city, ready to attack at any moment</style>.","source_cn":"而且，<style=highlight>喀尔马在城外…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DF11D0D8B8B4A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1826049021:1":{"text":"Tsk! They're dead from the neck up!","source_cn":"啧！真是愚蠢的怪物，他们那两颗大脑加起来恐怕还不如我的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F70377F920614AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1826049022:1":{"text":"You. Stay with Karma and only strike when necessary. Understood?","source_cn":"你——跟着喀尔马兄弟，必要时刻再出手，懂吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9814E190269B9DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1826049023:1":{"text":"Strike...? Oh...","source_cn":"出手……？哦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BE1D5A7E1B9B8A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:60:180601412:0":{"text":"The arrival of Shadewing, a Bantus assassin, interrupts Salazer's sadistic torment of the guests.","source_cn":"班题斯帝国的刺客——翼，出现在宴会上，打断了斯莱泽的施虐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2057546335744B41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:61:180601411:0":{"text":"At the banquet, Salazer reveals his true colors, taking control of all the early departers present and subjecting them to merciless torture.","source_cn":"宴会上，受邀前来的斯莱泽暴露了残忍嗜虐的真面目，控制住...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EF9951E4EA07566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族昆廷":{"text":"Sir Quentin","source":"贵族昆廷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"Salazer","source":"斯莱泽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:翼":{"text":"Shadewing","source":"翼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":67,"localized_text_count":58,"speaker_count":4}}